      "audio_id": "4077_13754_000002_000000",
      "speaker_id": "4077",
      "original_duration_seconds": 9.63,
      "transcript": "The troops, once in Utah, had to be provisioned; and everything the settlers could spare was eagerly bought at an unusual price. The gold changed hands.",
      "files": {
        "acoustic": "data/libritts-embedding-comparison/acoustic/4077_13754_000002_000000.wav",
        "unified": "data/libritts-embedding-comparison/unified/4077_13754_000002_000000.wav",
