      "audio_id": "2300_131720_000004_000000",
      "speaker_id": "2300",
      "original_duration_seconds": 9.73,
      "transcript": "Edison was from the first deeply impressed with the possibilities of water power, and, as this incident shows, was prompt to seize such a very early opportunity.",
      "files": {
        "acoustic": "data/libritts-embedding-comparison/acoustic/2300_131720_000004_000000.wav",
        "unified": "data/libritts-embedding-comparison/unified/2300_131720_000004_000000.wav",
